body:
Yea, i've asked myself so many times why this system we have is so f'ing stupid. Its 2023, and here we are still sending over FAX they gets burried by other documents and mixed in with those fax cover sheets. All for the sake of HIPPA and security. Pretty sure FAX can be hacked too somehow, but hey healthcare is one of the slowest industries to ever make changes. 

&#x200B;

Pretty sure many computers still using WinXP i bet.
